# Where CONTINUE puts the hero for a save (SAVES=<checkpoint dir>): the title,
# CONTINUE, "Change characters?" NO, then the state (area, hx, hz) once in
# play, and a shot. The game restarts the hero at a place of its own -- the
# castle-front save in front of the castle, the before-dungeon1 one (made in
# the same area) in front of the town's inn -- not where the save was made.
include ../scenarios/common.drive
log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
call continue
state life>0 90
sleep 4
state life>0 5
shot continued
